 "title": "IR26-21C/L110/TR8 infrared emitter, 940 nm, 1.6 mm round lens, side-view SMD",
 "source": {
  "document": "DIR-0000975",
  "revision": "Rev 5, release date 06/09/2022",
  "pages": 9
 },
 "summary": "A GaAlAs infrared emitting diode moulded in water-clear plastic with a 1.6 mm round right-angle lens, on a 3.2 mm by 1.6 mm two-terminal surface-mount base. The lens faces sideways from the board; the proposed mounting passes it through a 2.5 mm hole in the board between the two pads. At 20 mA it gives 3.0 mW/sr typical (1.0 mW/sr minimum) at a 940 nm peak over a 20° view angle, at 1.2 V typical forward voltage. Applications named are board-mounted IR sensors, miniature light barriers, floppy disk drives, optoelectronic switches and smoke detectors; the part is lead-free, RoHS and REACH compliant and halogen-free.",
